-- Threads (slug — target libraries):
--   1. isaiah-55-ho-every-one-that-thirsteth-come-ye-to-the-waters — NT (John 7, John 4, Revelation 21, 22) + Extras (Sirach 24) [extras]
--      (★★★ the free invitation to the living water; come buy without money — Wisdom's own invitation parallels it)
